WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.003
-Special Counsel Robert Mueller
has filed the first charges

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:06.171
in his investigation
of the Trump campaign's

00:00:06.171 --> 00:00:07.540
potential ties to Russia,

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.709
and, of course, news
that the charges were coming

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.377
sent President Trump
and his allies

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:13.379
into an unhinged frenzy
over the weekend.

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:15.481
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:19.819
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.956
The Trump White House knew today
was going to be a bad news day,

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:25.825
so you'd think they would savor
any chance to take a break

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.760
from the chaos
and project normalcy.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.028
For example, on Friday,

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:31.397
Trump engaged in the
presidential Halloween tradition

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.599
of handing out candy
to the children of members

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:35.000
of the White House press corps.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.437
And yet Trump could not resist
turning the innocent task

00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:41.007
of handing out candy
into an opportunity

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:43.610
to air his grievances
about the media.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:46.445
-I cannot believe the media

00:00:46.445 --> 00:00:48.748
produced
such beautiful children.

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:50.749
How the media did this,
I don't know.

00:00:50.749 --> 00:00:53.353
Do you know who they are?

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:54.754
Huh?
Do you know who they are?

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:56.689
They're the friendly media.

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:58.858
They're the frie--
That's the press.

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:02.595
Oh, you're gonna grow up
to be like your parents?

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:03.863
Mm.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.298
Don't answer.

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:07.766
That can only get me in trouble,
that question.

00:01:07.766 --> 00:01:11.303
So how does the press treat you?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.303 --> 00:01:13.706
I'll bet you get treated
better by the press

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.842
than anybody in the world,
right?

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.776
Well, congratulations, folks.

00:01:17.776 --> 00:01:20.280
You did a good job.
You did a good job.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.848
<i> Here</i> you did a good job.

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:24.383
I wouldn't say
you did very well here.

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:26.285
-That's because
you're the president,

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:27.753
not one of their children.

00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:29.188
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:30.824
"You never hug me.

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:32.491
You make me go to bed early.

00:01:32.491 --> 00:01:34.994
And when I want ice cream
for breakfast, you say no."

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.095
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:38.498
Also, look at the faces
of those kids.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.899
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.534
They're all looking at Trump
and thinking,

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:44.036
"You're the reason
my daddy drinks."

00:01:44.036 --> 00:01:45.738
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.674
But it actually --

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:49.175
It actually got worse than that,

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:51.143
because as he was
handing out the candy,

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:53.446
Trump made this comment
to some of the children.

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:57.016
-Who likes this?

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:59.552
You have no weight problems.
That's the good news, right?

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.888
-"You have no weight problem."

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:03.456
I can't wait to see how Trump

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:05.691
botches the presidential
turkey pardon.

00:02:05.691 --> 00:02:08.527
"You're gonna live, but
the rest of your family, dead.

00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:10.630
They're all dead.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:11.864
And you only have one more year.

00:02:11.864 --> 00:02:13.733
You're probably not getting
a second pardon."

00:02:13.733 --> 00:02:15.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:19.138
"So it's stuffing for you,
friend, but congratulations

00:02:19.138 --> 00:02:20.439
on what I hope
will be a good year.

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:22.175
Did we get the pictures?
Can I go now?"

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:23.643
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.445
So, Trump's weekend
got off to a rough start,

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:28.447
and then, this morning,
he woke up to even worse news.

00:02:28.447 --> 00:02:30.850
-Former Trump campaign manager
Paul Manafort

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.585
and his business associate
Rick Gates have been indicted

00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:35.421
by a federal grand jury
on a number of felony charges,

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:36.855
including money laundering

00:02:36.855 --> 00:02:39.158
and conspiracy
against the United States.

00:02:39.158 --> 00:02:40.527
-Now, I'm no legal expert,

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:42.695
but conspiracy
against the United States

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.263
does not sound good.

00:02:44.263 --> 00:02:46.899
Doesn't leave much room
for a plea bargain.

00:02:46.899 --> 00:02:49.101
"What if I just cop
to conspiracy against Delaware?

00:02:49.101 --> 00:02:51.004
You know Delaware
was asking for it!"

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:52.404
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.404 --> 00:02:55.341
Things really could not be worse
for Paul Manafort right now.

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.210
Although, on the bright side...

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:59.579
-You have no weight problems.
That's the good news, right?

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:03.983
-Okay.
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:07.220
Bright side.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.055
Now, the indictment
against Manafort

00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:11.357
alleges that he laundered
millions of dollars

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:14.294
and failed to register as an
agent of a foreign government.

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:17.130
The indictment has all kinds
of details about how Manafort

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.064
allegedly laundered money
by purchasing items

00:03:19.064 --> 00:03:20.533
from high-end stores,

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:23.268
including a home-entertainment
company, a men's clothing store,

00:03:23.268 --> 00:03:26.606
a landscaper in the Hamptons,
and an antique rug store.

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:29.942
Wow. He allegedly laundered
$1 million through a rug store,

00:03:29.942 --> 00:03:31.878
and not only that,
the rug he bought

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:33.879
wasn't even convincing.

00:03:33.879 --> 00:03:39.519
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:42.388
And Trump, of course,
could not help but respond

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:45.558
to the news today on Twitter
in a way that made very clear

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:47.660
he is not handling this well.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.362
First, he tweeted...

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:56.736
But then, three minutes later,
he added...

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:00.572
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.572 --> 00:04:01.974
He is so bad at this.

00:04:01.974 --> 00:04:03.142
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:04.944
It's like getting pulled over
and saying,

00:04:04.944 --> 00:04:06.312
"I wasn't speeding, officer.

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:09.481
And also, there's no cocaine
in the glove compartment!"

00:04:09.481 --> 00:04:11.150
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:16.589
"Don't look there!
It's a waste of your time!"

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:18.958
But maybe there's
a perfectly good explanation

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:21.093
for all 12 counts
against Manafort.

00:04:21.093 --> 00:04:24.530
I mean, does he sound
like a guilty man to you?

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:27.900
-So, to be clear, Mr. Trump
as no financial relationships

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.669
with any Russian oligarchs.

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:32.271
-If that's what he said,
I -- That's what I --

00:04:32.271 --> 00:04:34.941
That's obviously
what the -- our position is.

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:36.042
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:37.576
-"Uh, uh...

00:04:37.576 --> 00:04:42.381
Uh, um...uh, you know,
I'm gonna...

00:04:42.381 --> 00:04:45.785
Uh, you know,
I think I'll probably --

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:47.253
I think I'll probably
die in jail."

00:04:47.253 --> 00:04:48.621
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:50.556
But that Manafort news
isn't the only bombshell today,

00:04:50.556 --> 00:04:52.792
because it was also revealed
that Mueller's team

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:55.093
arrested a third
Trump campaign official,

00:04:55.093 --> 00:04:57.863
a foreign policy adviser
named George Papadopoulos,

00:04:57.863 --> 00:05:00.332
who, unlike Manafort,
has already pled guilty

00:05:00.332 --> 00:05:01.868
to lying to the FBI.

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:05.671
Papadopoulos allegedly met with
a professor tied to the Kremlin

00:05:05.671 --> 00:05:07.973
who promised dirt
on Hillary Clinton.

00:05:07.973 --> 00:05:09.509
According to the indictment...

00:05:17.182 --> 00:05:19.852
Wow. So it was the professor
in the dining room

00:05:19.852 --> 00:05:21.787
with the e-mails.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:21.787 --> 00:05:24.690
The Trump administration
is turning into a game of Clue,

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:27.526
but since it's Trump,
Clueless.

00:05:27.526 --> 00:05:29.295
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:33.232
Apparently...

00:05:33.232 --> 00:05:35.734
Apparently,
Papadopoulos tried to lie

00:05:35.734 --> 00:05:37.236
about this interaction
to the FBI.

00:05:37.236 --> 00:05:40.706
Papadopoulos said, falsely,
"he learned that information

00:05:40.706 --> 00:05:42.341
prior to joining the campaign,"

00:05:42.341 --> 00:05:43.876
but, in fact,
"The professor

00:05:43.876 --> 00:05:45.611
only took interest
in Papadopoulos

00:05:45.611 --> 00:05:47.379
because of his status
with the campaign."

00:05:47.379 --> 00:05:48.815
Of course he did.

00:05:48.815 --> 00:05:51.484
You think he was interested in
you because of your personality?

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:55.220
Or maybe it's just fun saying
your name in a Russian accent.

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:57.256
"Meester Papadabbaluh..."

00:05:57.256 --> 00:05:59.024
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.024 --> 00:06:01.227
"Please, let's have breakfast,
Meester Papadabbaluh."

00:06:01.227 --> 00:06:05.631
[ Laughter ]

00:06:05.631 --> 00:06:07.333
"You can have
the Papawaffaluhs."

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:08.968
[ Laughter ]

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:11.938
Of course, now that Manafort
has been charged,

00:06:11.938 --> 00:06:14.406
Trump and his team are trying
to distance themselves from him.

00:06:14.406 --> 00:06:16.742
But during the campaign,
Trump and his aides

00:06:16.742 --> 00:06:20.313
went out of their way repeatedly
to emphasize how important

00:06:20.313 --> 00:06:22.548
Manafort was
to their operations.

00:06:22.548 --> 00:06:24.983
-Who do you believe
will take over the campaign?

00:06:24.983 --> 00:06:26.619
Will it be Paul Manafort?

00:06:26.619 --> 00:06:29.755
-Yeah, I think Paul
is totally in charge.

00:06:29.755 --> 00:06:32.858
-Nobody should underestimate
how much Paul Manafort did

00:06:32.858 --> 00:06:35.894
to really help get this campaign
to where it is right now.

00:06:35.894 --> 00:06:38.130
-Paul Manafort
has done an amazing job.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:41.000
He's here someplace.
Where's Paul?

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.835
Paul Manafort.

00:06:42.835 --> 00:06:44.803
Oh, good.
You made it.

00:06:44.803 --> 00:06:45.905
-"Oh, good.
You made it.

00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:46.905
Where were you?"

00:06:46.905 --> 00:06:47.907
"I don't -- I was, um..."

00:06:47.907 --> 00:06:51.911
[ Laughter ]

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:55.013
"I was, uh...

00:06:55.013 --> 00:06:56.649
I was doin' some Russia stuff."

00:06:56.649 --> 00:06:58.284
[ Laughter ]

00:06:58.284 --> 00:07:00.185
When none of your defenses work,

00:07:00.185 --> 00:07:03.121
there's always the option
of ignoring the news completely.

00:07:03.121 --> 00:07:05.157
As other news outlets
were going wall-to-wall

00:07:05.157 --> 00:07:07.026
with coverage
of the Manafort indictment,

00:07:07.026 --> 00:07:09.695
here's what Fox News
thought was more important.

00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:13.298
-All right, this cheeseburger
emoji causing a frenzy online.

00:07:13.298 --> 00:07:14.934
We've been talking about it
all morning.

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:17.269
Can you see
what's wrong with this picture?

00:07:17.269 --> 00:07:20.272
The cheese is<i> underneath</i>
the hamburger.

00:07:20.272 --> 00:07:21.506
Who does that?

00:07:21.506 --> 00:07:24.643
-Unless the answer
is Paul Manafort, who cares?

00:07:24.643 --> 00:07:26.579
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:07:26.579 --> 00:07:28.647
You know...

00:07:28.647 --> 00:07:32.785
Fox News, if you really
want to talk about emojis,

00:07:32.785 --> 00:07:34.253
you could at least
focus on the ones

00:07:34.253 --> 00:07:36.289
that are relevant
to the Trump White House.

00:07:36.289 --> 00:07:37.622
[ Laughter ]

00:07:37.622 --> 00:07:40.258
Of course, Fox News
was just following the playbook

00:07:40.258 --> 00:07:42.528
they and the Trump team
have adhered to all weekend

00:07:42.528 --> 00:07:44.563
after the news
that pending criminal charges

00:07:44.563 --> 00:07:45.731
came down on Friday.

00:07:45.731 --> 00:07:48.200
Trump went on a Twitter rant
in which he tried

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.936
to distract from the news
and lashed out at everyone

00:07:50.936 --> 00:07:53.706
from James Comey to the
Democrats to Hillary Clinton.

00:07:53.706 --> 00:07:56.208
-President Trump released a
torrent of tweets this weekend,

00:07:56.208 --> 00:07:59.545
his frustration building
to an all-caps crescendo --

00:07:59.545 --> 00:08:01.814
"Never seen
such Republican anger and unity

00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:04.216
as I have concerning
the lack of investigation

00:08:04.216 --> 00:08:06.752
on Clinton-made fake dossier.

00:08:06.752 --> 00:08:10.823
The uranium to Russia deal,
the 33,000-plus deleted e-mails

00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:13.125
that Comey fix
and so much more.

00:08:13.125 --> 00:08:16.462
Instead, they look
at phony Trump/Russia collusion

00:08:16.462 --> 00:08:17.996
which doesn't exist.

00:08:17.996 --> 00:08:21.267
The Dems are using this terrible
and bad for our country

00:08:21.267 --> 00:08:22.868
witch hunt for evil politics,

00:08:22.868 --> 00:08:25.071
but the Republicans
are now fighting back

00:08:25.071 --> 00:08:26.271
like never before.

00:08:26.271 --> 00:08:29.208
There is so much guilt
by Democrats, Clinton,

00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:31.343
and now the facts
are pouring out.

00:08:31.343 --> 00:08:32.545
Do something!"

00:08:32.545 --> 00:08:33.812
-"Do something"?

00:08:33.812 --> 00:08:35.514
He sounds like a supervillain

00:08:35.514 --> 00:08:38.784
barking orders at his henchmen
after James Bond escapes.

00:08:38.784 --> 00:08:40.552
"He's getting away!
Do something!"

00:08:40.552 --> 00:08:42.588
But his henchmen
are yelling back, "We can't!

00:08:42.588 --> 00:08:44.724
We're all under
federal Investigation!"

00:08:44.724 --> 00:08:46.459
[ Laughter ]

00:08:46.459 --> 00:08:47.960
But The most disturbing thing --

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.961
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:49.961 --> 00:08:52.565
The most disturbing thing
about the right-wing reaction

00:08:52.565 --> 00:08:54.066
to the Mueller news this weekend

00:08:54.066 --> 00:08:56.402
was their frothing obsession
with Hillary Clinton.

00:08:56.402 --> 00:08:58.771
The writers manufactured a
series of fake Clinton scandals

00:08:58.771 --> 00:09:00.372
to try to muddy the waters
and distract

00:09:00.372 --> 00:09:02.040
from the very real
Russia investigation.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:05.243
For example, they've dredged up
an old uranium deal from 2010

00:09:05.243 --> 00:09:07.680
that was approved
by nine different agencies

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:10.082
and had nothing to do
with Hillary Clinton.

00:09:10.082 --> 00:09:12.451
To try to claim she was the one
who colluded with Russia.

00:09:12.451 --> 00:09:14.153
And Trump himself
immediately picked up

00:09:14.153 --> 00:09:15.721
on that absurd talking point.

00:09:15.721 --> 00:09:18.524
-Well, I think
the uranium sale to Russia

00:09:18.524 --> 00:09:20.125
and the way it was done,

00:09:20.125 --> 00:09:23.962
so underhanded with tremendous
amounts of money being passed,

00:09:23.962 --> 00:09:27.633
I actually think
that's Watergate modern-age.

00:09:27.633 --> 00:09:29.535
-You know what?
From now on, I think you should

00:09:29.535 --> 00:09:31.336
only get
to talk about uranium deals

00:09:31.336 --> 00:09:33.472
if you can actually explain
what uranium is.

00:09:33.472 --> 00:09:34.573
Mr. President?

00:09:34.573 --> 00:09:35.908
-You know what uranium is,
right?

00:09:35.908 --> 00:09:38.811
This thing called nuclear
weapons and other things.

00:09:38.811 --> 00:09:41.346
Like, lots of things
are done with uranium,

00:09:41.346 --> 00:09:42.882
including some bad things.

00:09:42.882 --> 00:09:48.120
[ Laughter ]

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.455
-Trump always sounds
like a high schooler

00:09:50.455 --> 00:09:52.424
who forgot to study
for the quiz.

00:09:52.424 --> 00:09:54.259
"Oxygen --
I don't have to tell you,

00:09:54.259 --> 00:09:55.461
oxygen does good things,

00:09:55.461 --> 00:09:57.663
and then you have uranium,
bad things.

00:09:57.663 --> 00:10:02.534
And tungsten -- Oh, don't get me
started on tungsten.

00:10:02.534 --> 00:10:04.036
It's where
the tongue comes from."

00:10:04.036 --> 00:10:06.405
We're entering
a new and intense phase

00:10:06.405 --> 00:10:08.106
of the Mueller investigation,

00:10:08.106 --> 00:10:10.342
and Trump and his allies
are doing everything they can

00:10:10.342 --> 00:10:11.577
to stop or discredit it.

00:10:11.577 --> 00:10:13.779
On the one hand,
Trump claims his team

00:10:13.779 --> 00:10:15.280
is doing
some really good things,

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:17.583
but in reality,
it looks like they were up to...

00:10:17.583 --> 00:10:18.750
-Some bad things.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.352
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:20.352 --> 00:10:24.090
[ Cheers and applause ]

